# X11 programs (D-025): the first one starts Xwayland; its window is a task
# framed like any other; Alt+F4 asks it to close (WM_DELETE_WINDOW).
# Needs Xwayland and xeyes/xclock (x11-apps) on the machine.
wait 1500
type DESKTOP
key enter
wait 1500
type START xeyes
key enter
wait 5000
expect-task 2
expect WINDOWS => normal xeyes
shot 110-xeyes
key alt+f4
wait 1500
expect-task 1
# In RetroDOS an X11 program fills the screen like any other.
key ctrl+alt+f1
wait 1000
type START xclock
key enter
wait 4000
expect-task 2
shot 111-xclock-full-screen
